<title>USA: Fairfax Financial put on rating watch.</title>
<headline>Fairfax Financial put on rating watch.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it placed the Triple B Plus senior debt rating of Fairfax Financial Holdings Ltd on rating watch-developing.</p>
<p>It said the action follows Fairfax's recent announcement it was acquiring Compagnie Transcontinentale de Reassurance, a French reinsurance company.</p>
<p>A final rating determination will be made following completion of additional due diligence.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
